<section background-color="heading">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="38" vertical-align="center">
      <p role="eyebrow">Conclusion</p>
      <h1 font-size="36pt">Rhythm becomes an ethical argument</h1>
      <p font-size="lg">Form and meaning cannot be separated. Six/eight alternation repeatedly opens and closes space; rhyme carries one line into the next, as Kiều’s choices carry consequences forward.</p>
      <hr horizontalAlign="left" width="xs" thickness="md" color="accent"/>
      <h3 role="subheading">Dignity survives what justice does not repair.</h3>
      <p font-size="sm">The ending offers survival and reunion—not a simple reset.</p>
